        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"\" class=\"plainlinks ambox ambox-yellow\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"ambox-image\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Classic\" title=\"Classic\"><img alt=\"Classic\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/a/af/WoW_Classic_logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/85?cb=20190315120441\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"85\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"WoW Classic logo.png\" data-image-key=\"WoW_Classic_logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"ambox-text\"><b>The subject of this article was removed in <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_4.0.3a\" title=\"Patch 4.0.3a\">patch 4.0.3a</a> but remains in <i><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Classic\" title=\"World of Warcraft: Classic\">World of Warcraft: Classic</a></i>.</b>\n<div class=\"amsmalltext\">\n<ul><li>This includes items and quests that can no longer be obtained or are now deprecated.</li></ul>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mob\" title=\"Mob\"><img alt=\"Mob\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c1/Combat_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20151213203709\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Combat 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Combat_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Lord Mayor Morrison</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/b/b1/Lord_Mayor_Morrison.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20110722021858\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Lord Mayor Morrison\"><img alt=\"Image of Lord Mayor Morrison\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"168\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Lord Mayor Morrison.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lord_Mayor_Morrison.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/b/b1/Lord_Mayor_Morrison.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/168?cb=20110722021858\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Title</th><td>\n&lt;Pyrewood Council Leader&gt;</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>&#160;(Humanoid)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Level</th><td>\n15</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Horde</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Pyrewood_Council\" title=\"Pyrewood Council\">Pyrewood Council</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Occupation</th><td>\nMayor</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Pyrewood_Village\" title=\"Pyrewood Village\">Pyrewood Village</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Silverpine_Forest_(Classic)\" title=\"Silverpine Forest (Classic)\">Silverpine Forest</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nDeceased (lore)<br /> Killable <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft\" title=\"World of Warcraft\"><img alt=\"WoW Icon update\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"WoW Icon update.png\" data-image-key=\"WoW_Icon_update.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/3/38/WoW_Icon_update.png/revision/latest?cb=20180602175550\" /></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Lord Mayor Morrison</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> and leader of the <a href=\"/wiki/Pyrewood_Council\" title=\"Pyrewood Council\">Pyrewood Council</a> who appears in <a href=\"/wiki/Pyrewood_Village\" title=\"Pyrewood Village\">Pyrewood Village</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Silverpine_Forest_(Classic)\" title=\"Silverpine Forest (Classic)\">Silverpine Forest</a> during <span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"H\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c4/Horde_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20201010153315\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Horde 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Horde_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;[15]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Pyrewood_Ambush\" title=\"Pyrewood Ambush\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Pyrewood Ambush</span></a></span>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Objective_of\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objective of</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Relatives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Relatives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Patch_changes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Patch changes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objective_of\">Objective of</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"H\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c4/Horde_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20201010153315\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Horde 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Horde_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;[15]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Pyrewood_Ambush\" title=\"Pyrewood Ambush\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Pyrewood Ambush</span></a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>In <i><a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_of_the_Lich_King\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wrath of the Lich King\">Wrath of the Lich King</a></i>, he lost his elite status.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Relatives\">Relatives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"background: transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/2b/Questionmark-medium.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019212216\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Questionmark-medium\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"41\" height=\"55\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Questionmark-medium.png\" data-image-key=\"Questionmark-medium.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/2b/Questionmark-medium.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019212216\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #808080; border-bottom: 1px solid #808080; padding: 1ex 1em; margin-top: 0.3ex; max-width: 34em;\"><small style=\"line-height: 120%;\">This section includes <b>speculation</b> on characters that might be related, usually because they may share a last name. <b>It should not be taken as representing official lore.</b></small></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>He may be related to <a href=\"/wiki/Brambley_Morrison\" title=\"Brambley Morrison\">Brambley Morrison</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Vinnie_Morrison\" title=\"Vinnie Morrison\">Vinnie Morrison</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Patch_changes\">Patch changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_4.0.3a\" title=\"Patch 4.0.3a\">Patch 4.0.3a</a> (2010-11-23):</b> Removed.   <i></i><br /></li>\n<li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_The_Burning_Crusade\" title=\"World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade\"><img alt=\"Bc icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Bc icon.gif\" data-image-key=\"Bc_icon.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/0/0e/Bc_icon.gif/revision/latest?cb=20110218184702\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_2.3.0\" title=\"Patch 2.3.0\">Patch 2.3.0</a> (2007-11-13):</b> No longer elite.   <i></i><br /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]<